# Symbiotic Daemon Secrets Template
#
# Copy this file to config/.env.secrets and fill in values.
# NEVER commit .env.secrets — it contains real credentials.
# File permissions should be 0600 (chmod 600 config/.env.secrets)
#
# Matrix credentials are NOT configurable via env vars — they come from
# Docker secrets (/run/secrets/symbiotic_matrix_password), the encrypted
# vault, or self-registration. See docs/architecture/daemon-bootstrap.md.
#
# IMPORTANT: Do NOT leave optional vars as empty (VAR=) — this overrides
# Rust defaults with blank strings. Comment them out instead.

# ============================================================
# Required Secrets by Mode
# ============================================================
#
# byok (bring your own keys):
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY             (required; Claude Code CLI)
#   OPENAI_API_KEY                (required; Codex CLI)
#   SYMBIOTIC_X_CLIENT_ID         (required for bookmarks sync)
#   SYMBIOTIC_X_CLIENT_SECRET     (required for bookmarks sync)
#   Matrix credentials             (via Docker secret)
#
# managed:
#   SYMBIOTIC_METERED_PLAN_ID     (required)
#   Matrix credentials             (via Docker secret)
#
# both modes:
#   Push gateway keys (optional, for mobile push notifications)
#   SYMBIOTIC_VAULT_MASTER_KEY    (auto-generated if absent)
# ============================================================

# --- Vault encryption (auto-generated if absent) ---
# 64-char hex string for encrypting the credential vault.
# Generate with: head -c 32 /dev/urandom | xxd -p -c 256 | tr -d '\n'
#SYMBIOTIC_VAULT_MASTER_KEY=

# --- AI Provider credentials ---
# Required for byok mode (agent CLI providers).
#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Optional fallback router key:
#SYMBIOTIC_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# --- Claude Code CLI (LOCAL DEV ONLY — TOS prohibits VPS/server use) ---
# Uses your existing Pro/Max subscription. Auto-detected on PATH.
#SYMBIOTIC_CLAUDE_CODE_BINARY=claude
#SYMBIOTIC_CLAUDE_CODE_MODEL=sonnet

# --- Codex CLI (subscription-based, daemon-safe, Apache 2.0) ---
# Uses your ChatGPT Plus/Pro subscription. Auto-detected on PATH.
#SYMBIOTIC_CODEX_BINARY=codex
#SYMBIOTIC_CODEX_MODEL=o3

# --- Gemini API (Google AI, free tier: 1000 req/day) ---
# API key auth — explicitly permitted for programmatic/daemon use.
#GEMINI_API_KEY=
#SYMBIOTIC_GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# --- Metered plan (managed mode) ---
# Required for managed mode. Plan ID from Symbiotic metered billing.
#SYMBIOTIC_METERED_PLAN_ID=

# --- X API credentials (optional, needed for bookmarks sync) ---
#SYMBIOTIC_X_CLIENT_ID=
#SYMBIOTIC_X_CLIENT_SECRET=

# --- VPS provisioning credentials (optional) ---
# API provisioner endpoint + token
#SYMBIOTIC_VPS_PROVISION_ENDPOINT=
#SYMBIOTIC_VPS_PROVISION_TOKEN=
# Hetzner Cloud token (alternative driver)
#SYMBIOTIC_HCLOUD_TOKEN=
# Cloudflare tunnel token for public mobile access (required for --access-mode public)
#SYMBIOTIC_CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL_TOKEN=
# Optional SSH public key injected during provision
#SYMBIOTIC_VPS_SSH_PUBLIC_KEY=

# --- Push notification gateway keys (optional) ---
# Unified gateway key (if using single gateway):
#SYMBIOTIC_PUSH_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
# Or split APNS + FCM gateway keys:
#SYMBIOTIC_PUSH_APNS_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
#SYMBIOTIC_PUSH_FCM_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
